#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_deduction.field_school_scholarship_deduction__amount_recognized
msgid ""
"Sum of this deduction's own Recognition documents' Amount, counting only "
"those in Done status."
msgstr ""
"Total Jumlah dari dokumen Pengakuan milik potongan ini sendiri, hanya yang "
"berstatus Selesai."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_deduction
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_deduction.field_school_scholarship_deduction_line__price_tax
