msgstr "Pajak"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_deduction
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_deduction.field_school_scholarship_deduction__reconciled
msgid ""
"Technical flag mirroring whether the receivable journal item has been fully "
"reconciled."
msgstr ""
"Penanda teknis yang mencerminkan apakah item jurnal piutang telah "
"direkonsiliasi sepenuhnya."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_deduction
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_deduction.field_school_scholarship_deduction__deferred_account_id
msgid ""
"Temporary asset account each Line posts to instead of its own Final Account "
"while Recognition Method is ``Deferred``. Defaulted from the Award's own "
"Deferred Discount Account. Required while Recognition Method is ``Deferred``."
msgstr ""
"Akun aset sementara tempat setiap Baris diposting sebagai pengganti Akun "
"Akhir miliknya selama Metode Pengakuan adalah ``Deferred``. Diisi otomatis "
"dari Akun Diskon Ditangguhkan milik Pemberian. Wajib selama Metode Pengakuan "
"adalah ``Deferred``."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_deduction
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_deduction.field_school_enrollment_revenue_recognition_line__scholarship_deduction_line_id
msgid ""
"The enrollment-mode scholarship deduction line released by this Recognition "
"Line, when it originates from a scholarship deduction rather than an "
"invoiced payment term detail."
msgstr ""
"Baris potongan beasiswa mode pendaftaran yang dilepas oleh Baris Pengakuan "
"ini, bila berasal dari potongan beasiswa dan bukan dari detail termin "
"pembayaran yang difaktur."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_deduction
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_deduction.field_school_scholarship_deduction__partner_id
msgid ""
"The student's contact partner. Must match the Partner of every allocated "
"invoice."
msgstr ""
"Mitra kontak siswa. Harus sama dengan Mitra setiap faktur yang dialokasikan."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_deduction
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_deduction.field_school_scholarship_deduction_recognition__ratio
msgid ""
"This document's own Amount divided by the deduction's own Amount Total -- "
"the proportion of each Line released by this document."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah dokumen ini sendiri dibagi Jumlah Total milik potongan itu sendiri -- "
"proporsi setiap Baris yang dilepas oleh dokumen ini."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_deduction
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_deduction.field_school_scholarship_deduction_line__price_total
msgid "Total"
msgstr "Total"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_deduction
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_deduction.field_school_scholarship_deduction__name
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_deduction.field_school_scholarship_deduction_recognition__name
msgid ""
"Transaction/document number\n"
"\n"
"* Unique indentifer of transaction\n"
"* Leave '/' to automatically generate number\n"
"* Change '/' into any number/identifier to manually assign number.\n"
"  Manual number assignment can be done in 'Draft' state\n"
"  Only user with 'Can Manualy Assign Number' policy can manually assign "
"number.\n"
"* Transaction with number other than '/' can not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Nomor transaksi/dokumen\n"
"\n"
"* Pengenal unik transaksi\n"
"* Biarkan '/' agar nomor dibuat otomatis\n"
"* Ubah '/' menjadi nomor/pengenal apa pun untuk menetapkan nomor secara "
"manual.\n"
"  Penetapan nomor manual dapat dilakukan pada status 'Draf'\n"
"  Hanya pengguna dengan kebijakan 'Dapat Menetapkan Nomor Secara Manual' "
"yang dapat menetapkan nomor secara manual.\n"
"* Transaksi dengan nomor selain '/' tidak dapat dihapus."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_deduction
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_deduction.field_customer_invoice__has_scholarship
msgid ""
"True once at least part of this invoice has been settled by a scholarship "
"deduction."
msgstr ""
"Benar setelah setidaknya sebagian faktur ini diselesaikan oleh potongan "
"beasiswa."

