#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_deduction
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_deduction.field_school_scholarship_deduction__recognition_method
msgid ""
"``Deferred`` once Recognition Date falls after this document's own Date -- "
"meaning the service this deduction pays for has not started yet. "
"``Enrollment`` once every invoice this document allocates against belongs to "
"an enrollment with Revenue Recognition enabled and not yet Done -- set "
"automatically by ``_03_set_enrollment_recognition_method`` right before "
"opening, overriding any other value. Defaults automatically but may be "
"overridden manually."
msgstr ""
"``Deferred`` begitu Tanggal Pengakuan jatuh setelah Tanggal dokumen ini "
"sendiri -- artinya layanan yang dibayar potongan ini belum dimulai. "
"``Enrollment`` begitu setiap faktur yang dialokasikan dokumen ini milik "
"pendaftaran dengan Pengakuan Pendapatan aktif dan belum Selesai -- diatur "
"otomatis oleh ``_03_set_enrollment_recognition_method`` tepat sebelum "
"dibuka, menimpa nilai lain apa pun. Terisi otomatis tetapi dapat diubah "
"secara manual."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_deduction
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_deduction.field_school_scholarship_deduction__recognition_state
msgid ""
"``Not Applicable`` while Recognition Method is ``Immediate``; otherwise "
"``Pending`` before any Recognition is Done, ``Partially Recognized`` while "
"Amount Recognized is below Amount Total, and ``Recognized`` once it reaches "
"it."
msgstr ""
"``Not Applicable`` selama Metode Pengakuan adalah ``Immediate``; selain itu "
"``Pending`` sebelum Pengakuan mana pun Selesai, ``Partially Recognized`` "
"selama Jumlah Diakui di bawah Jumlah Total, dan ``Recognized`` begitu "
"mencapainya."
